<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Curriculum — A Field Course in Creating AI Models</title>
<meta name="description" content="A single-file field course on creating AI models: architectures, data, metrics, and training — taught in seven modules with hands-on exercises." />
